    "updated_at": "2016-05-10T19:25:28Z",
    "body": "Ah, I missed that the signature for `setTimeout` is declared in [the `WindowOrWorkerGlobalScope` interface definition](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#windoworworkerglobalscope), in a different place than the algorithm for evaluating it.\n\nThanks for clarifying!\n",
