    "updated_at": "2016-05-10T19:29:38Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I'm not sure what to do about cases like that. It's a pretty established pattern though, e.g. almost everything on Window is defined elsewhere. Maybe in the popup you get when clicking on the `<dfn>` for setTimeout, there should be a distinguished link for the IDL definition.\n",
